*begin	ffgps


; Survey:		Fountains Fell GPS Survey 1
; Surveyors:	Noel Snape, Holly Bradley and Andrew Wright

; Date:	01/01/2016

; Instruments:	Leica Geosystems ATX1230 GPS
; Undertaken with connectivity to Lieca basestations via mobile boradband, accuracy to below 0.02m
; Measured in OSGB36 (WGS84 also recorded for records)
; 2m survey pole autocorrected in readings

;--------------------------------------

; OSGB36 co-ordinates are for the OS 100km square SD 
; to obtain full length co-ordinates, add 300000 to Easting and 400000 to Northing
;--------------------------------------
;Survey points taken 01/01/2016


